Note on version pinning: the headers under x/capstone/include are 5.0.1 to
match the implementation embedded in frida-gum. They must not be used with
the 6.0 implementation — Capstone 6 changed the internal layout of cs_detail
(MAX_IMPL_W_REGS 47 vs 20, MAX_NUM_GROUPS 16 vs 8, union offset 154 vs 92),
so mixing headers with the wrong implementation silently misreads arm64
operands. UCDisassembler.m includes the 6.0 headers by relative path from
x/capstone6/include so the two header sets never share an -I search domain.

The 6.0 sources were restored from git history (09cd3d6) into x/capstone6/
in 3.5.0, now actively compiled with the flx6 symbol prefix described above.
